@startuml sequence-transfer-between-currencies
title Transfer between wallets of different currencies
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Client
participant "individuals-api" as IA
participant "currency-rate-service" as CRS
participant "transaction-service" as TS
database "transaction DB\n(shard of the user)" as DB

note across
  Every call of individuals-api: service token, circuit breaker.
  Timeout, 5xx, no connection, open breaker → 503 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE.
  Validation, wallet and offer token checks, DB errors: transaction-service sequence-transfer.
end note

== init: nothing is written ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer/init\n(UAH wallet → EUR wallet, amount 150.00)
IA -> TS: GET /api/v1/wallets/user/{userUid}
TS --> IA: 200 wallets with currencies
alt a wallet not found or same currency
    IA -> TS: transfer/init without rates (sequence-transfer)
else different currencies
    IA -> CRS: GET /api/v1/rates?from=UAH&to=EUR
    IA -> CRS: GET /api/v1/rates?from=UAH&to=USD\n(no call: source USD → 1, target USD → the pair rate)
    alt CRS 404
        IA --> Client: 422 RATE_NOT_FOUND, transaction-service not called
    else CRS 400 / 401 / 403
        IA --> Client: 500 INTERNAL_ERROR, CRS answer only in the log
    else rates 0.0221 and 0.024
        IA -> TS: POST transfer/init + sourceCode UAH, destinationCode EUR, rate 0.0221, rateToUsd 0.024
        TS -> DB: both wallets of the user
        alt wallet currencies ≠ UAH, EUR
            TS --> IA: 400 CURRENCY_MISMATCH
        else 150.00 × 0.024 = 3.60 USD < 1.00 (transfer.min-conversion-amount-usd)
            TS --> IA: 400 AMOUNT_TOO_SMALL
        else
            TS -> TS: fee 0.5% = 0.75, total 150.75 UAH;\ntargetAmount = 150.00 × 0.0221 = 3.32 EUR (HALF_UP, 2 digits; rate not rounded)
            alt targetAmount = 0.00
                TS --> IA: 400 AMOUNT_TOO_SMALL
            else balance < total
                TS --> IA: 400 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
            else
                TS -> TS: offerToken: terms + rate + targetAmount, 5 min
                TS --> IA: 200 amount, fee, total, rate, targetAmount, expiresAt, offerToken
            end
        end
        alt CURRENCY_MISMATCH (our bug)
            IA --> Client: 500 INTERNAL_ERROR
        else
            IA --> Client: the same status and body
        end
    end
end

== confirm: rate from the token, currency-rate-service not called ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer/confirm (offerToken)
IA -> TS: transfer/confirm
group one DB transaction
    TS -> DB: lock both wallets
    TS -> DB: source − 150.75 UAH, target + 3.32 EUR
    TS -> DB: transactions COMPLETED, rate 0.0221, target_amount 3.32
end
TS --> IA: 200 COMPLETED, transactionId
IA --> Client: 200 COMPLETED, transactionId
@enduml
